    "VideoPad Video Editor Project File",
    "3.9",
    "Project file saved by VideoPad Video Editor, an application used for creating digital videos; stores references to video files and can include transitions, effects, and audio; used for saving the users editing progress. VideoPad Video Editor projects support several input video formats. The software can also export VPJ files to CDs, DVDs, and Blu-ray discs, as well as.AVI,.WMV,.MPG,.MOV,.3GP, YouTube, and other formats. Windows NCH VideoPad Video Editor.",
