    "3.8",
    "Slideshow project created by MediaShow, a program used for creating home-made videos and slideshows; saves a list of images with transition effects, text, and background music; can be exported to.WMV or.MPG (MPEG2) formats and then shared with friends and family members. MediaShow slideshows can be shared on YouTube and FaceBook using functions available in the software. NOTE: CyberLink discontinued the MediaShow software. Windows CyberLink MediaShow 6 —  (Discontinued). Trial. MAXScript (.MS) file saved in an encrypted format; can automate processes within 3ds Max; the secure format protects the scripts source code from being viewed or modified by other users; often used for commercial scripts that are distributed to the public. Windows Autodesk 3ds Max 2023.",
