    ".MANI",
    "Mine-imator Project File",
    "3.7",
    "File created by Mine-imator, a program used for making Minecraft animations; used as a project file and contains the animation timeline as well as the mobs, items, and terrain for the scene; can be exported to an.AVI video when complete. Mine-imator can be used for making Minecraft movies published to YouTube and other video sharing websites. Windows Mine-imatorFree.",
