    "3.7",
    "Custom plugin written for AMX Mod, a metamod plugin for Valve Half-Life and related games; adds additional features and functionality to the game. AMX Mod X plugins use the.AMXX file extension. Windows AMX Mod Referenced by Valve Half-Life Linux AMX Mod Referenced by Valve Half-Life. Video or animation saved in Adobes Motion Exchange format; developed as a standard format for exporting video projects (such as After Effects.AEP files) to other programs. The AMX format was also supported by LiveMotion, which was discontinued by Adobe in November 2003. Windows Adobe After Effects 2023. Adobe LiveMotion.",
