    "3.7",
    "Video file that can be played on the Sony PlayStation Portable (PSP) handheld device; typically used for TV shows and movies; may be downloaded from the P-TV (portable TV) video download service in Japan or from Go!View in the UK and Ireland. MGV files can be transferred to a Sony PSP via a MemoryStick memory card or a USB connection. Windows Transfer to a Sony PSP. Voice or instrument used by the Yamaha Tyros and high-end PSR keyboards; saved in the MegaVoice format, which captures the subtle nuances of an instrument to creates realistic and expressive sounds. MGV voice files may be loaded by a compatible Yamaha keyboard using a USB connection or memory card. Mac Transfer to a Yamaha keyboard Windows Transfer to a Yamaha keyboard.",
