    "3.5",
    "Project file created by KTooN, a 2D animation program; saves an animation timeline and supports both vector and raster graphics; can be exported to.OGV,.AVI,.MPG, and.SWF formats when complete; sometimes used for distributing free 2D animation content. Linux KTooNFree.",
