    ".CAMV",
    "Camtasia Video File",
    "3.5",
    "Video file exported by Camtasia Studio, a program used for creating screen casts; saves video that was exported for playback on the Web using RealPlayer; can be played if the Camtasia RealPlayer plug-in is installed. NOTE: Camtasia Studio no longer uses the CAMV format for exported video. Instead, it uses.MP4 files and Flash for Web exports. Windows TechSmith Camtasia.",
