    ".TIVO",
    "TiVo Video File",
    "3.5",
    "Video file recorded by a TiVo DVR device; stores the video using MPEG-2 compression and includes copyright protection; used for saving TV shows and movies to watch later. Windows TiVo Desktop —  (Discontinued). Roxio Creator NXT Pro 9. CyberLink PowerDVD 21. VSO ConvertXtoDVD. DRD Systems VideoReDo. JRiver Media Center. Mac TiVo Desktop —  (Discontinued). Roxio Toast 20.",
    "Windows TiVo Desktop —  (Discontinued). Roxio Creator NXT Pro 9. CyberLink PowerDVD 21. VSO ConvertXtoDVD. DRD Systems VideoReDo. JRiver Media Center. Mac TiVo Desktop —  (Discontinued). Roxio Toast 20.",
