    ".DIVX",
    "DivX-Encoded Movie",
    "3.3",
    "High-quality, high-compression video codec used for digital video distribution; compresses video to a fraction of the original size with minimal loss in quality; supports video resolutions up to 1080 HD. The DivX format is recognized by several software video playback programs as well as some DVD players and other consumer electronics. Windows File Viewer Plus — Get it from Microsoft. DivX Player. Microsoft Windows Video —  (Discontinued)  Included with OS. RealNetworks RealPlayer 20/20. Roxio Creator NXT Pro 9. CyberLink PowerDVD 21. CyberLink PowerDirector 365. Audials One 2022. Xilisoft Video Converter Ultimate. VideoLAN VLC media player. Mac DivX. Eltima Elmedia Player. Apple QuickTime Player with DivX codec Included with OS. VideoLAN VLC media player. Roxio Toast 20. Linux VideoLAN VLC media player. iOS VideoLAN VLC for Mobile. RealNetworks RealTimes: Video Maker. Android RealNetworks RealTimes Video Maker.",
