    "Video file created in the NuppelVideo format, which is commonly used by the MythTV free home entertainment software; often contains a video recorded from a video stream. NUV files can be converted to.MKV,.AVI, or.MP4 files using mythnuv2mkv. VLC media player and MPlayer can play some NUV videos. Windows File Viewer Plus — Get it from Microsoft. MPlayer. VideoLAN VLC media player. Mac MythTV. MPlayer. ShedWorx Smart Converter. VideoLAN VLC media player. Linux MythTV. MPlayer. mythnuv2mkv. VideoLAN VLC media playerFree.",
