    "Nintendo DS Movie File",
    "3.3",
    "Video container format used for playing movie files on the Nintendo DS portable gaming device; may be converted from other video formats to DPG using MoonShell or another converter program. Can be played on the Nintendo DS by transferring the DPG file to a DS-compatible GameBoy Advance card. May also be played back on a PC using supporting player. NOTE: Several programs can be used for converting standard video files to the DPG format, including dpg4x and DPG Converter. However, to play a DPG file in Windows, use the dpgshow.exe program included with the Moonshell download. Windows Moonshell. BatchDPG. 4Media DPG Converter —  (Discontinued). Trial Aiseesoft DPG Converter. dpg4x. Mac dpg4x. Aiseesoft DPG Converter for Mac. Linux dpg4xFree.",
