    "3GPP Multimedia File",
    "3.2",
    "Multimedia format created by the 3rd Generation Partnership Project (3GPP); designed to transmit multimedia files over the Internet; used capture and playback video on mobile phones; more commonly seen with the.3GP extension. Windows Adobe Flash Professional CC —  (Discontinued). Trial Roxio Creator NXT Pro 9. VideoLAN VLC media player. MPlayer. Mac Adobe Flash Professional CC —  (Discontinued). Trial Apple QuickTime Player Included with OS. Roxio Toast 20. VideoLAN VLC media player. Linux VideoLAN VLC media player. MPlayerFree.",
