    "MPEG Movie File",
    "3.2",
    "Video encoded in MPEG format, a commonly compression applied to digital video files; MPEG-2 is the most commonly used type of MPEG compression. The MPE file extension is short for the more common.MPEG extension. Windows Microsoft Windows Media Player Included with OS. Nullsoft Winamp. CyberLink PowerDirector 365. Other video player Mac Apple QuickTime Player Included with OS. Roxio Popcorn. Other video player.",
