    "3.2",
    "Video format used by Google Video Player, a video playback program developed by Google; similar to an.AVI file and encoded in DivX4 with an MP3 compressed audio track; can also be played by VLC if the file does not incorporate DRM encryption. Google Video Player was discontinued in 2007 and is no longer distributed by Google. Windows Google Video Player VideoLAN VLC media player. Mac Google Video Player Eltima Elmedia Player. VideoLAN VLC media player. Linux VideoLAN VLC media playerFree.",
