    "AQTitle Subtitles File",
    "3.2",
    "Movie subtitles file created in the AQTitle format, an older format used by the Czech subtitling community; uses a plain text format that specifies when each subtitle should be displayed; not a common format, but supported by some modern video players. Windows VideoLAN VLC media player. Any text editor Mac VideoLAN VLC media player. Any text editor Linux VideoLAN VLC media player. Any text editor.",
