    "Roxio MyDVD Project",
    "3.1",
    "DVD project created by Roxio MyDVD, a program bundled with Roxio Creator used for creating home DVDs; saves a 2D movie project (3D projects use the.DMSD3D extension) and may created for DVD, VCD/SVCD, Blu-ray, or AVCHD media types. To open Roxio MyDVD within Roxio Creator, choose Create DVDs from the Home screen. Windows Roxio Creator NXT Pro 9.",
