    "3.1",
    "Project created and used by Wax, a video compositing and special effects program; stores project settings, such as video resolution and frame rate, and any edits made by the user; can be saved and edited at different times. NOTE: The WXP file can be exported to the.AVI,.MPG, and.WAV formats. Windows DebugMode Wax 2Free.",
