    "Project file created by Roxio Video Copy & Convert, a program included with Roxio Creator; stores settings for converting a video file from one format to another; enables users to save reusable conversion settings. VCPF files save the conversion quality setting, output format, and the save directory. Windows Roxio Creator NXT Pro 9.",
