    "Apple QuickTime Movie File",
    "2.8",
    "Video file created by QuickTime, a video capture and movie playback program; stores compressed video and audio data in a proprietary Apple format; more commonly seen with the.MOV extension. Windows Apple QuickTime Roxio Creator NXT Pro 9. CyberLink PowerDVD 21. Mac Apple QuickTime Roxio Toast 20. Roxio Popcorn.",
