    "Creative Webcam Video Effects File",
    "2.8",
    "File used by Live! Cam, a program that allows users to chat online using Creative webcams; contains effects that morph or overlay video feeds; used to enhance social online chatting with fun and creative effects. To add an effect, use the Advanced Video FX program within the Live! Cam software. Windows Creative Live! Cam Creative Advanced Video FX Mac Creative Live! Cam Creative Advanced Video FX Linux Creative Live! Cam Creative Advanced Video FX.",
