    "2.8",
    "Photo slide show created by older versions of PhotoSuite, a program included with Roxio Creator; contains a sequence of photos, transitions, and audio; used for saving and loading slide show projects. PhotoSuite slide shows now use the.DMSP extension. Windows Roxio Creator NXT Pro 9.",
