    "ProPresenter Quartz Composition",
    "2.7",
    "Composer documents created by ProPresenter in order to view Quartz files (.QTZ); contains processed and rendered graphical data used for animations; appears similar to a QuickTime movie but is much smaller in size. ProPresenter is a multimedia package used for organizing and displaying presentations. Its most often used by churches, sporting events, and television broadcasts. It supports a variety of media including images, audio, and video. Windows Renewed Vision ProPresenter. Mac Renewed Vision ProPresenterFree.",
