    "2.6",
    "Proprietary video format used by MAGIX video editing products such as MAGIX Movie Edit Pro (also called MAGIX Video Deluxe) and MAGIX Digital Foto Maker (now called MAGIX Photo Manager); saves video for a video project; can be converted to other more common formats, such as.MP4, using the export functions in the software. Windows MAGIX Movie Edit Pro. MAGIX Photo Manager.",
