    ".MODD",
    "Sony Video Analysis File",
    "2.6",
    "Information file that stores metadata about a video clip recorded with a Sony camcorder; saved along with a high definition.M2TS or.MTS file or a standard definition.MPG file; may include date and time information and other relevant data. The data stored in MODD files is used by the Video Analysis feature within Sony Picture Motion Browser. Windows Sony Picture Motion Browser —  (Discontinued).",
