    "Interactive Flash presentation created by Qarbon presentation software; contains the Flash.SWF file, an.HTML file, and the.QVP source file, which stores images, audio files, and other resources; used for storing project assets together. NOTE: The .viewlet extension actually is used for a folder and not a file. The HTML file within the folder (that references the SWF file) can be opened in any Web browser with the Flash Player plug-in installed. Windows Qarbon ViewletBuilder. Adobe Flash Player —  (Discontinued). Mac Qarbon ViewletBuilder. Adobe Flash Player —  (Discontinued). Linux Qarbon ViewletBuilder. Adobe Flash Player —  (Discontinued).",
