    "2.5",
    "Video or audio file format used for broadcasting live media from websites; known for its broadcast quality that adapts to individual user connections; discontinued in 1998. Windows LiteVDO VDOLive Player or Web browser plug-in Mac LiteVDO. If file name is HEATHEN.VDO, file may be a virus that infects Word documents (.DOC files); may infect PE.EXE files in Windows 95; should be deleted or removed by an anti-virus program. Also known as WM97/Heathen-A.. Windows Do not open - may contain a harmful virus. Delete immediately.",
