    "MPEG-2 Video",
    "2.5",
    "Video file encoded using the MPEG-2 codec, which is used for DVD video and digital TV broadcasts; significantly reduces the size of the video data by using lossy audio and video compression. MPEG-2 files are typically saved with the standard.MPG extension. Audio files that are compressed with the MPEG-2 codec use the.MP2 extension. Windows Microsoft Windows Media Player Included with OS. VideoLAN VLC media player. Mac Apple QuickTime Player Included with OS. VideoLAN VLC media player. Linux VideoLAN VLC media playerFree.",
