    ".GOM",
    "GOM Media File",
    "2.2",
    "File used by GOM Player, an audio and video playback program; may contain various kinds of audio or video data that is used for playback in the software. NOTE: While the GOM Player registers the .gom file association when the software is installed, it doesnt appear that .gom files are actually used for storing or playing audio or video data. Windows GRETECH GOM PlayerFree.",
    "Windows GRETECH GOM Player.",
